#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:34
msgid "2. Color Palette & Roles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:36
msgid "Primary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:37
msgid ""
"**Mistral Orange** (`#fa520f`): The core brand color — a vivid, saturated"
" orange-red that anchors the entire identity. Used for primary emphasis, "
"the brand block, and the highest-signal moments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:38
msgid ""
"**Mistral Flame** (`#fb6424`): A slightly warmer, lighter variant of the "
"brand orange used for secondary brand moments and hover states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:39
msgid ""
"**Block Orange** (`#ff8105`): A pure orange used in the gradient block "
"system — warmer and less red than Mistral Orange."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:41
msgid "Secondary & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:42
msgid ""
"**Sunshine 900** (`#ff8a00`): Deep golden amber — the darkest sunshine "
"tone, used for strong accent moments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:43
msgid ""
"**Sunshine 700** (`#ffa110`): Warm amber-gold — the core sunshine accent "
"for backgrounds and interactive elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:44
msgid ""
"**Sunshine 500** (`#ffb83e`): Medium golden — balanced warmth for mid-"
"level emphasis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:45
msgid ""
"**Sunshine 300** (`#ffd06a`): Light golden — for subtle warm tints and "
"secondary backgrounds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:46
msgid ""
"**Block Gold** (`#ffe295`): Pale gold — soft background accents and "
"gentle warmth."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:47
msgid ""
"**Bright Yellow** (`#ffd900`): The brightest tone in the gradient — used "
"at the \"top\" of the block identity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:49
msgid "Surface & Background"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:50
msgid ""
"**Warm Ivory** (`#fffaeb`): The lightest page background — barely tinted "
"with warmth, the foundation canvas."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:51
msgid ""
"**Cream** (`#fff0c2`): The primary warm surface and secondary button "
"background — noticeably golden."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:52
msgid ""
"**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): Used for maximum contrast elements and "
"popover surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:53
msgid ""
"**Mistral Black** (`#1f1f1f`): The primary dark surface for buttons, "
"text, and dark sections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:54
msgid ""
"**Accent Orange** (defined as `hsl(17, 96%, 52%)`): The functional accent"
" color for interactive states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:56
msgid "Neutrals & Text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:57
msgid ""
"**Mistral Black** (`#1f1f1f`): Primary text color and dark button "
"backgrounds — a near-black that's warmer than pure #000."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:58
msgid ""
"**Black Tint** (defined as `hsl(0, 0%, 24%)`): A medium dark gray for "
"secondary text on light backgrounds."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:59
msgid "**Pure White** (`#ffffff`): Text on dark surfaces and CTA labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:61
msgid "Semantic & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:62
msgid ""
"**Input Border** (defined as `hsl(240, 5.9%, 90%)`): A cool-tinted light "
"gray for form borders — one of the few cool tones in the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:63
msgid ""
"**White Overlay** (`oklab(1, 0, 0 / 0.088–0.1)`): Semi-transparent white "
"for frosted glass effects and button overlays."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:65
msgid "Gradient System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:66
msgid ""
"**Mistral Block Gradient**: The signature identity — a multi-step "
"gradient flowing through Yellow (`#ffd900`) → Gold (`#ffe295`) → Amber "
"(`#ffa110`) → Orange (`#ff8105`) → Flame (`#fb6424`) → Mistral Orange "
"(`#fa520f`). This gradient appears in the logo blocks, section "
"backgrounds, and decorative elements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:67
msgid ""
"**Golden Landscape Wash**: Photography and backgrounds use warm amber "
"overlays creating a consistent golden temperature across the page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:68
msgid ""
"**Warm Shadow Cascade**: Multi-layered golden shadows that build depth "
"with amber-tinted transparency rather than gray."
msgstr ""

