#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:89
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:90
msgid ""
"**Single weight, maximum impact**: The entire system uses weight 400 "
"(regular) — even at 82px. This creates a surprisingly elegant effect "
"where the size alone carries authority without needing bold weight."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:91
msgid ""
"**Ultra-tight at scale**: Line-heights of 0.95–1.00 at display sizes "
"create text blocks where ascenders nearly touch descenders from the line "
"above — creating dense, poster-like composition."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:92
msgid ""
"**Aggressive tracking on display**: -2.05px letter-spacing at 82px "
"compresses the hero text into a monolithic block."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:93
msgid ""
"**Uppercase as emphasis**: Strategic `text-transform: uppercase` on "
"button labels and section markers creates a formal, European signage "
"quality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:94
msgid ""
"**No weight variation**: Unlike most systems that use 300–700 weight "
"range, Mistral uses 400 everywhere. Hierarchy comes from size and color, "
"never weight."
msgstr ""

