#: ../../source/templates_mistral.ai.md:198
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: Mistral uses a single but extraordinarily complex "
"shadow — **five cascading layers** of amber-tinted shadow (`rgba(127, 99,"
" 21, ...)`) that build from a close 16px offset to a distant 400px "
"offset. The result is a rich, warm, \"golden hour\" lighting effect that "
"makes elevated elements look like they're bathed in afternoon sunlight. "
"This is the most distinctive shadow system in any major AI brand."
